OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fscattered showers during the evening.
OL,7,FThe showers will ease and clear
OL,8,Fthrough the night, but mist and fog
OL,9,Fpatches spreading in overnight will
OL,10,Fbring some patchy drizzle.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FThe odd light shower at first,
OL,13,Fotherwise a mainly dry but cloudy
OL,14,Fmorning. Rain will spread across from
OL,15,Fthe west through the afternoon,
OL,16,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,17,Fheavier later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
